Top of the config layer: os.Open guarded by errors.Is(fs.ErrNotExist) (returns defaults), set() errors
wrapped "config: %s:%d: %w", scanner error flattened with %v, validate()'s joined errors returned as is.
Expect os.Open's errors behind "config: %w" (ErrNotExist-like ones removed or marked possibly handled), set's origins
behind "config: %s:%d: %w", opaque "config: read %s: %v" with NO bufio/os origin behind it, ErrNoToken and
*ValidationError behind errors.Join.
